  "tour.analysesBody": "Five optional analyses: older sky surveys, a defect check, nearby stars in 3D, the visits as sound, and the comet 3I/ATLAS.",
  "tour.analysesTitle": "Look closer if you want",
  "tour.back": "Back",
  "tour.blinkBody": "Each frame is one SPHEREx visit, laid on a fixed sky grid. Something that moves shifts between frames; stars stay put. Barnard's Star shifts from visit to visit.",
  "tour.blinkTitle": "Watch the blink",
  "tour.close": "Close",
  "tour.countsBody": "Your rating shows at once in the header and the tally, with other people's ratings beside it. On a candidate it also sets the status in the queue and on the sky. Five ratings give a status: agreement, not a discovery.",
  "tour.countsBodyUnrated": "Once you rate, your rating shows at once in the header and the tally, with other people's ratings beside it. On a candidate it also sets the status in the queue and on the sky. You can still rate now.",
  "tour.countsTitle": "Your rating counts at once",
  "tour.doneBody": "Start with the review queue, or click anywhere on the sky. You can replay this tour from Menu.",
  "tour.doneTitle": "You're ready",
  "tour.exploreBody": "Drag to look around and scroll to zoom. Click any point to open the SPHEREx images taken there.",
  "tour.exploreTitle": "Explore the sky",
  "tour.menu": "Take the tour",
  "tour.next": "Next",
  "tour.openBarnard": "Open Barnard's Star",
  "tour.openBody": "Next picks a candidate and flies there; Open blink opens it. For practice we will open Barnard's Star, a star known to move fast.",
  "tour.openQueue": "Open review queue",
  "tour.openTitle": "Open the images",
  "tour.queueBody": "The review queue lists what the machine flagged. Unidentified pairs have no catalog explanation: your call. Known movers are stars Gaia DR3 already tracks: the answer key.",
  "tour.queueTitle": "Candidates to check",
  "tour.rateBody": "Pick Moving, Not moving or Noise or artifact. One rating per browser, and you can change it. Try it now, or press Next.",
  "tour.rateTitle": "Rate what you see",
  "tour.shareBody": "Copy link saves this exact place. Anyone who opens the link lands on the same spot with these images open, so they can check it and rate it too.",
  "tour.shareTitle": "Share this place",
  "tour.skip": "Skip tour",
  "tour.skipShort": "Skip",
  "tour.start": "Start tour",
  "tour.stepOf": "{n} / {total}",
  "tour.toolsBody": "On the right: This view, layers, Star guide and zoom. Search finds candidates, 2MASS names and coordinates. Press ? for keyboard shortcuts.",
  "tour.toolsTitle": "More tools",
  "tour.waiting": "The images are still downloading. The highlight moves to them once they are ready.",
  "tour.welcomeBody": "HEIMDALLR uses SPHEREx images to watch stars and other objects move across the sky. Our team regularly updates a list of recommended places to check, and your ratings decide which of them stand out. The tour takes about a minute.",
